# ==============================================================================
# SkillPassport Environment Variables Template
# ==============================================================================

# Supabase Public API Configuration
# Obtain these from your Supabase project dashboard -> Project Settings -> API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# Optional: Set to true if you want to enforce strict network-only Supabase calls
VITE_REQUIRE_REMOTE_SUPABASE=false

# ==============================================================================
# GITHUB OAUTH CONFIGURATION (SERVER-SIDE ONLY IN SUPABASE DASHBOARD)
# ==============================================================================
# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE:
# DO NOT add GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET or SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY to this file
# or to Vercel frontend environment variables.
#
# To enable GitHub OAuth for SkillPassport:
# 1. In GitHub -> Settings -> Developer Settings -> OAuth Apps -> New OAuth App:
#    - Application name: SkillPassport
#    - Homepage URL: https://your-domain.vercel.app (or http://localhost:3000)
#    - Authorization callback URL: https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
# 2. In Supabase Dashboard -> Authentication -> Providers -> GitHub:
#    - Enable GitHub Provider: ON
#    - Client ID: <Client ID from GitHub OAuth App>
#    - Client Secret: <Client Secret from GitHub OAuth App>
# 3. In Supabase Dashboard -> Authentication -> URL Configuration:
#    - Site URL: https://your-domain.vercel.app
#    - Redirect URLs:
#      - https://your-domain.vercel.app/passport
#      - http://localhost:3000/passport
# ==============================================================================
